================================================================================
  DESCRIPTION
================================================================================

  FoundationBridge is a native gateway (a single Swift binary) that exposes
  Apple's on-device language model — the FoundationModels framework, at the core
  of Apple Intelligence — to the whole agentic ecosystem. Available surfaces:
  MCP stdio, OpenAI-compatible REST, Anthropic-compatible REST, SSE streaming,
  proxy mode and CLI. Coming (v2.1): MCP Streamable-HTTP, ACP (Zed), WebSocket
  and client SDKs (first-class Swift + Python/TS/Go/Rust guides).

  Goal: let any AI agent (Claude Code, Claude Desktop, Cursor, Zed, OpenAI/
  Anthropic clients) use the local model — free, private, offline — without
  rewriting any integration.

================================================================================
  STACK
================================================================================

  Language  : Swift 6 (strict concurrency)
  Server    : Hummingbird 2 (+ HummingbirdTesting for integration tests)
  MCP       : modelcontextprotocol/swift-sdk (0.12.x)
  Backend   : FoundationModels (macOS 26, Apple Silicon)
  Tests     : swift-testing (57 tests passing)
  CLI       : manual argument parsing (no dependency)

================================================================================
  STRUCTURE
================================================================================

  Sources/FoundationBridgeCore/      Errors, availability, TextGenerating,
                                     ContextManager, BearerAuth, MockTextGenerator
  Sources/FoundationBridgeSession/   SessionManager actor (named multi-turn)
  Sources/ProtocolConversion/        OpenAI <-> Anthropic models, validation
  Sources/FoundationModelsBackend/   Real FoundationModels binding + streaming
  Sources/FoundationBridgeServer/    Hummingbird server: REST + SSE + auth
  Sources/FoundationBridgeMCP/       Router + MCP stdio server (swift-sdk)
  Sources/FoundationBridgeCLI/       Executable (version/diagnose/generate/serve/mcp)
  Tests/                             swift-testing (Core, Conversion, Session,
                                     MCP, Server integration/golden)
  docs/                              Specs, plans, session journals

================================================================================
  REQUIREMENTS
================================================================================

  - Apple Silicon Mac (M1+)
  - macOS 26 (Tahoe)
  - Apple Intelligence enabled + model downloaded
  - Swift 6.x / Xcode 26 (or Command Line Tools)

================================================================================
  CREDITS
================================================================================

  Author : Aïssa BELKOUSSA

================================================================================
  NOTES
================================================================================

  FoundationModels is exclusive to recent Apple platforms. FoundationBridge does
  not target Linux/Windows/x86. The on-device model is specialized for short
  tasks (summarization, extraction, classification, dialogue), not broad general
  knowledge. Context window ~4096 tokens.

